# The secrets-hunt answer sheet. Gitignored, and must stay out of the image
# too: the image is pullable/inspectable, and nothing in it reads this file
# (brutalist-init runs migrate + seed, which use db/seeds/; secrets are
# imported over stdin, see db/import-secrets.ts). Mirrors .gitignore.
